{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2011-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1320105600, "end_date": 1320710399, "month_true_total": 49, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:53:15 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1767761", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997700552", "personaname": "PLAiNER", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/plainer/", "num_games_owned": 378, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5820, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5820, "last_played": 1374640042, "avatar": "6306e3f7f945ad5e55e5f4d38edef3b37533f64b"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1320697303, "timestamp_updated": 1320697303, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2963900", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015189530", "personaname": "GoodOldPolly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/goodoldpolly/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 57, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57, "last_played": 1349938800, "avatar": "f9c0ab31f3be1c966077e5f6caf7411863feb936"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't understand how Valve works, I really don't. While other companies charge people 60$ for really bad, bad games; Valve can take the luxury of developing a great game, with almost eternal replay value for free. This must be witchcraft, WITCHCRAFT.", "timestamp_created": 1320685574, "timestamp_updated": 1320685574, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2855388", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013633699", "personaname": "Erin Webb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/erinwebb/", "num_games_owned": 757, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 301, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "0bd98065e64eebeef676c5278fc6f9e4a13792be"}, "language": "english", "review": "like skyrim with aliens", "timestamp_created": 1320605455, "timestamp_updated": 1397116725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.564265072345733643", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3315763", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020693176", "personaname": "ContaCt | FR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020693176/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 32810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14375, "last_played": 1527701331, "avatar": "f6a22ad65a202c875cb6b2375e9a30663f91f728"}, "language": "english", "review": "Très bon jeu de coop tactique, ambiance \"Aliens, le retour\". De plus, d'excellents mods amateurs sont téléchargeables sur le net.", "timestamp_created": 1320600742, "timestamp_updated": 1320600742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3835317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027952806", "personaname": "TBomb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027952806/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 26726, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 25, "playtime_at_review": 26701, "last_played": 1790380882, "avatar": "338b74dc2b49e74caff5a0e9e4e77a93e7367007"}, "language": "english", "review": "Valve dumped this game on the community and said \"Here, do something with this.\", giving the Steam community a fun free game with a fulfilling 4-player co-op campaign, but  without any further support or incentive for people to continue playing. Bundled with the free SDK, they ecouraged the community to use Hammer to develop custom maps to keep the game going, however it was far from simple to use, and even when you followed instructions by the letter, it hardly ever worked properly.\n\nI spent hundreds of hours developing maps, bundling map packs for the public, and reviewing maps on the Swarm Armory (SwarmArmory.com) to supplement its shrinking fan base, and eventually decided I had spent enough time on it. It's a good game. I never really got tired of it. But you can't expect a single person to make a good map with replay value on their own. Good content requires time and money, and a team of people working full time. Since it was free, DLC wouldn't have been out of the question.", "timestamp_created": 1320570616, "timestamp_updated": 1320570616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}